Distribution media built by "make dist":
  build/dist/dos.img    a hard disk with DOS only (DOS\ holds the utilities,
                        EFICD.SYS and MSCDEX give CD-ROM drives a letter;
                        VDM.EXE runs 8086 DOS programs where the processor
                        has the IA-32 instruction set)
  build/dist/win30.iso  the Interface Manager CD (built with the WDK); run
                        D:\SETUP from DOS to install
dist/dos and dist/win hold the configuration files copied onto them.
tools/run.sh --dist boots the disk with the CD.
